{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a76e6d0114d60b0261c5c1787045c74ee40bacdf7eb63aca16b2ec63302416e4",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_c:2_4_048_02_09_c:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f97bc8982b183501d0128a6c6804cc76d43ae8e669f6afaf1a28fdb5e1dea4a",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●P酱，辛苦啦。\n马上就要正式开始了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_c:2_4_048_02_09_c:cmd-000009:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64e728e34c460daca6c7fae30d8bbd9c27c4838289248577ef26ea7da32836e1",
      "text": "终于要开始了呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_c:2_4_048_02_09_c:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:587a4cf83e0ffef0db2ae0090651b60b984561b3f6862674e82f438aaf894ba7",
      "text": "发挥出\n练习的成果吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_c:2_4_048_02_09_c:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac21f197a76feae703c17b3989e52597c371c45fdb8adb1170f5d217d6ce6d65",
      "text": "嗯。因为有很多和平时不一样的动作，\n虽然稍微有点紧张，但我会加油的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_c:2_4_048_02_09_c:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:734c17bf88421a554e6fa24950aef98f218efcf05d39f2b361167fb7dcfb2c5c",
      "text": "无论是舞蹈、武打还是打游戏，我们三个人都练习了无数遍，正式演出一定能顺利的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_c:2_4_048_02_09_c:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4e33f89bb351aadd00752c41b1e972398f9b8326290e39ecd8af44b14661b2f",
      "text": "一定能够回应你和大家的期待。\n……所以，请看着我哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_c:2_4_048_02_09_c:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:993732a065fad4ca5228d897703a24b3e072d5ff85939b0ee978469867d11c4a",
      "text": "那我现在就去\n做最后的确认了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_c:2_4_048_02_09_c:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3113ae1fd27adc966e40bade07f24ddc69c45389be1f747a97ed2ab0ff1703d",
      "text": "啊，不过，在开演前还能再见你一面吗？\n等你那边的工作结束之后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:048mom_402_2_4_048_02_09_c:2_4_048_02_09_c:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46c01f74ed721b421cf5c371fee13f4bf38d221f550746fb6ed57d82073ebbd6",
      "text": "唔，算了，刚才那句不算。\n那我出发啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
